                                        "entry_id": "cfcfdb72-0883-301b-9820-105faa7a90dc",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "неол. название международной компании — оператора популярной социальной сети и одноименного мобильного приложения для обмена короткими видео продолжительностью от пятнадцати секунд до одной минуты"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3ab00f0f-7fea-4862-bc91-dae67649db51",
                                                "sense_id": "e0efa40a-2b81-3aec-b0bb-30b1ca3ad39a",
                                                "text": "Мировой судья участка № 422 Таганского района Москвы во вторник признал «ТикТок» (TikTok Pte.Ltd) виновным в совершении административного правонарушения, предусмотренного ч. 2 ст. 13.41 КоАП РФ. То есть за нарушение порядка ограничения доступа к информации, доступ к которой подлежит ограничению в соответствии с законодательством РФ."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "word_linkages": []
            },
            {
                "entry_id": "1ee6e456-b0a8-37eb-92c8-71bc3835d482",
                "word": "TikTok",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "5c54bcb0-79c2-42b0-b450-cabf5377cb80",
                        "entry_id": "1ee6e456-b0a8-37eb-92c8-71bc3835d482",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "TikToks"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "6816ebae-3c8a-3181-8837-15fe01028e21",
                        "entry_id": "1ee6e456-b0a8-37eb-92c8-71bc3835d482",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A small video that can be viewed online, particularly one hosted on TikTok."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "informal",
                            "neologism"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ffbb2686-41b5-45ab-925e-3427d66162ae",
                                "sense_id": "6816ebae-3c8a-3181-8837-15fe01028e21",
                                "text": "How are these vaccine TikToks fooling so many people?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "bfe15310-5315-480a-85fe-49cf84f2ecf9",
                                "sense_id": "6816ebae-3c8a-3181-8837-15fe01028e21",
                                "text": "Imagine The Smiths or Joy Division making TikToks to promote their music. Think about Nick Cave or Joni Mitchell, and just imagine them negotiating with this bullshit."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "473fdc65-e133-33e8-9fe2-ab9c4e1db84e",
                        "entry_id": "1ee6e456-b0a8-37eb-92c8-71bc3835d482",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A TikTok account."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "informal"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ffbac977-7b25-4d25-8465-38d70359da63",
                                "sense_id": "473fdc65-e133-33e8-9fe2-ab9c4e1db84e",
                                "text": "“Are there any volunteers who would like to make their first video in front of everybody?” The first person who raised his hand was a dad in his late forties who had been a participant in our training school. I remember this guy because earlier in the training he had told me that his son had told him, “Dad, whatever you do, don’t start a TikTok.”"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c2d33000-fb64-4e89-8c07-2cadb7c7b174",
                                "sense_id": "473fdc65-e133-33e8-9fe2-ab9c4e1db84e",
                                "text": "If you’ve never been on TikTok, we don’t recommend you start a TikTok just to promote your campaign."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c27c6673-3372-417e-802c-060eb4240017",
                                "sense_id": "473fdc65-e133-33e8-9fe2-ab9c4e1db84e",
                                "text": "Start a TikTok and share your ideas, join a club or group, or audition for the play, etc."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7604af1e-27c0-43da-8e7e-a7b0ecee3a13",
                                "sense_id": "473fdc65-e133-33e8-9fe2-ab9c4e1db84e",
                                "text": "If you look at the podcasting sphere, which was a way of voices that had been pushed to the margins to carve out a space, now it’s just a content farm and one more space people have to participate in, like how brands have to have a TikTok, a presence in all these different mediums."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "625306db-4e4f-406c-ab75-31f912deaf1a",
                                "sense_id": "473fdc65-e133-33e8-9fe2-ab9c4e1db84e",
                                "text": "So, instead of just trusting that Spotify is always gonna do right by you, have a Spotify, have an Apple Music, Instagram, have a Facebook, have a TikTok, have a YouTube, have a merch site, have a Patreon."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9c198730-40ac-48ad-a07d-780dd5401989",
                                "sense_id": "473fdc65-e133-33e8-9fe2-ab9c4e1db84e",
                                "text": "We should start a TikTok for the drama department. […] We can do educational videos. Like, about the Poor Theatre, but with the dancing."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "60bd193b-c978-4d78-a2b8-9901218f4f24",
                                "sense_id": "473fdc65-e133-33e8-9fe2-ab9c4e1db84e",
                                "text": "We wanted some press so we started a TikTok and other social media."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
